WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.025
In conduction the particles stay in place and pass energy on by collisions.

2
00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:10.000
A metal bar heated at one end: blue is cool, red is hot.

3
00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:15.375
Particles vibrate harder and bump their neighbours; none of them move along.

4
00:00:16.027 --> 00:00:20.902
That is conduction; in liquids and gases the warm fluid itself moves.
